- AXIS: NEGLECTED OPERATOR - the reciprocal of the daily range divided by the daily return, using INV(TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1)) / TS_PCTCHANGE($close, 1)
- AXIS: RESIDUAL - the residual of regressing daily volume on daily range, using REGRESI($volume, TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1), 60)
- AXIS: ASYMMETRY - the difference between up-range days and down-range days, conditional on the sign of the next-day return, using DELTA(TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1), TS_RETURN($close, 1))
- AXIS: UNUSUAL PAIRING - the covariance between the daily range and the daily volume, using TS_COVARIANCE($high, $volume, 1)
- AXIS: CROSS-FAMILY PRODUCT - the product of the rank of the range and the rank of the volume, using RANK(TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1)) * RANK($volume)
- AXIS: SHAPE, NOT LEVEL - the skewness of the daily return distribution, using SKEW($return, 1)
- AXIS: DEPTH - the rolling standard deviation of the range within the rolling standard deviation of the return, using TS_STD(TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1), 60) / TS_STD($return, 60)
- AXIS: INVERSION - one minus the ratio of the daily range to the previous day's range, using 1 - (TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1) / DELAY(TS_RANGE($high, $low, 1), 1))

